# g++-multilib builds the 32-bit companion Vulkan layer: a 32-bit game renders
# through wine's i386 winevulkan, so only an i386 layer can be loaded into it,
# and setup.py builds it best effort -- without multilib the package would
# ship 64-bit only and the overlay would never appear in those games.
